    {
      "ply": 17,
      "san": "e4",
      "human_san": "e4",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "A Pawn sacrifice already done by Alekhine\nagainst Eliskases, which, very wisely, declined it (as did Capablanca in this\ngame).",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "",
      "system_symbol": null,
      "is_key_moment": false,
      "final_comment": false,
      "both_present": false,
      "human_only": true,
      "system_only": false,
      "neither": false
    },
    {
      "ply": 18,
      "san": "Bxc4",
      "human_san": "Bxc4",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Black missed the chance to play g5, which leads to a slight advantage for Black along [pv:g5 Bg3 dxe4 fxe4 Nxe4], leaving White with a hanging piece while targeting the bishop on h4\u2014exploiting loose material is a straightforward way to keep the pressure on. Instead, 9...Bxc4 lets the advantage slip away to equality (-0.31 \u2192 +0.24, Stockfish:16) as [pv:Bxc4 Bxc4 dxc4 Qa4+ c6], and even the exchange with Qa4+ fails to preserve the edge Black had held.",
      "system_symbol": "?!",
      "is_key_moment": true,
      "final_comment": true,
      "both_present": false,
      "human_only": false,
      "system_only": true,
      "neither": false
    },
    {
      "ply": 19,
      "san": "Bxc4",
      "human_san": "Bxc4",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "The most accurate move, maintaining White's advantage (+0.27, Stockfish:16), as [pv:Bxc4 dxc4 Qa4+ c6 Qxc4] immediately leaves Black's pieces passive, limiting their counterplay. The line may also give White a bishop for a knight, though in return White risks leaving a piece hanging. Bxf6 is a comparable option that leads to equality along [pv:Bxf6 Qxf6 Bxc4 dxc4 Qa4+], where Black could leave a piece hanging\u2014but Bxc4 keeps the clearer edge by restraining Black's activity at once.",
      "system_symbol": "!",
      "is_key_moment": true,
      "final_comment": true,
      "both_present": false,
      "human_only": false,
      "system_only": true,
      "neither": false
