    {
      "ply": 45,
      "san": "Rae1",
      "human_san": "Rae1",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Rae1 is the most accurate move, maintaining White's advantage (+2.62, Stockfish:16) as the line [pv:Rae1 Nc5 Rxe4+ Nxe4 Re1] may set White up to target the knight on e4\u2014a central outpost that often gives Black practical counterplay. Rfe1 is a comparable option that also gives White a winning advantage, [pv:Rfe1 Nc5 Rxe4+ Nxe4 Re1].",
