      "san": "Rxg7",
      "human_san": "Rxg7",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Rxg7 gives White a winning advantage (+2.40, Stockfish:16) at the cost of leaving Black's king under immediate pressure, as the line [pv:Rxg7 Rxe4+ Kf8 Be7+ Kg8] shows \u2014 once the king is driven into the open, coordinated checks are hard to parry in an endgame. Kd7 was a roughly comparable option that also gives White a winning advantage [pv:Kd7 Rxe4 Rxg7 f6 Rh7]. White went on to win the game.",
